 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon a time, just few years after you did, a brave little girl named Ruby went exploring in the woods behind her house. She came upon a cozy little door hidden in tree trunk, and inside found a lovely fire that was already burning brightly. She was invited to sit on cozy bench by the fire to warm up, and while she was warm and cosy, she heard stories about the woods behind her house. Yes, it is. Then maybe start with just the part about warming up. Lots of youngsters love fires. Sure. Why don't scientists trust atoms? Because they make up everything. Ha, nice one.",
